{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00818","headline":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 观德舞 · 张昭","name":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 观德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高庙明灵再啓图，金根玉辂幸神都。\n巢阿丹凰衔书命，入昴飞星献宝符。\n正换熏弦娱赤子，忽登仙驾泣苍梧。\n荐樱鹤馆笳箫咽，酌鬯金楹劒佩趋。\n星俎云罍兼鲁礼，朱干象箾杂巴渝。\n氤氲龙麝交青琐，髣髴[锡]銮下蘂珠。\n荐豆奉觞亲玉几，配天合祖耀璿枢。\n受厘饮酒皇欢洽，仰俟余灵泰九区。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}